cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Grounding-Source Comparison Exhibit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Clouatre"
    given-names: "Hugues"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4291-1999"
    affiliation: "Universite de Bordeaux"
repository-code: https://github.com/clouatre-labs/grounding-source-exhibit
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-11-22"
version: "2.3.0"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered, four-arm comparison of grounding-source payloads
  (frozen llms.txt, full frozen knowledge-graph.json, the regenerated
  content-complete OKF v0.3 bundle, and the per-question index-relevant
  OKF slice) on 63 sealed questions per arm across four preregistered
  families with a per-family answerability map (correct abstention
  scores 1). Item score: kg-json 61/63, llms.txt 55/63 (unchanged),
  okf-bundle 50/63, okf-index-relevant 53/63; after Holm-Bonferroni
  only kg-json vs okf-bundle separates (p=0.0059) and neither OKF arm
  separates from llms.txt. Supersedes version 0.1.0 (v1 seal, DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.24410381).
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - knowledge-graph
  - open-knowledge-format
  - pre-registered-experiment
  - reproducibility
  - llm-evaluation
identifiers:
