    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24410380
    description: Concept DOI (all versions)
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24441791
    description: Version DOI (v2.2.0, four-arm run with capture-repair audit trail; single-zip artifact set)
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24453471
    description: Version DOI (v2.3.0, sealed four-arm rerun on the content-complete OKF bundle; single-zip artifact set)
